  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Step is an internationally recognised programme for school children to reduce violence and teach social skills. Thus, the pupils learn to deal with conflicts in a non-violent way. PMU will carry through this project in co-operation with the local organisation Karposh.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&quot;Second Step&quot; &#xE4;r ett internationellt erk&#xE4;nt program f&#xF6;r skolbarn f&#xF6;r att minska v&#xE5;ld och l&#xE4;ra ut social kompetens. D&#xE4;rigenom l&#xE4;r sig skolbarnen att hantera konflikter p&#xE5; annat s&#xE4;tt &#xE4;n med v&#xE5;ld. PMU genomf&#xF6;r detta i makedonska skolor tillsammans med den lokala organisationen Karposh.</narrative>
  </description>
